            {text:`Make every mark below 50 turn red automatically.`, options:[`PivotTable`,`Data validation`,`Conditional formatting`], answer:2, fb:`Conditional formatting changes how cells look when they meet a condition.`},
            {text:`Stop anyone from typing a mark greater than 100.`, options:[`Conditional formatting`,`Linking worksheets`,`Data validation`], answer:2, fb:`Data validation restricts what can be entered into a cell.`},
            {text:`Find a student's name automatically from his or her ID number in a class list.`, options:[`Sorting`,`VLOOKUP`,`SUM`], answer:1, fb:`VLOOKUP looks up a value in a table and returns related information.`}
