          tutor:[
            {h:`Functions`, p:`<p><b>SUM</b> adds, <b>AVERAGE</b> finds the mean, <b>IF</b> decides between two results, <b>VLOOKUP</b> looks something up.</p>`},
            {h:`Look versus entry`, p:`<p>Changing how cells <i>look</i> = conditional formatting. Controlling what may be <i>entered</i> = data validation.</p>`}
          ],
